{
  "format": "sqlib-notebook/1",
  "title": "Start here",
  "library": "urn:sqlib:library:rail",
  "cells": [
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md1",
      "source": "# Start here\n\nThe Rail library is a small city network: sixteen stations on four lines. Each cell below runs a saved query, group or rule set. Run them in order."
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md2",
      "source": "## A query with a parameter\n\n`VALUES ?line { UNDEF }` in the text makes `?line` a parameter. The argument is a table of rows."
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c1",
      "label": "Stations on the Red line",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-stations-on-line",
      "out": "red",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "line": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/red"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md3",
      "source": "Two rows in the argument is still one call."
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c2",
      "label": "Stations on the Red and Green lines",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-stations-on-line",
      "out": "redGreen",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "line": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/red"
              }
            },
            {
              "line": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/green"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md4",
      "source": "## One cell feeds the next\n\nThe first cell finds the lines through Central. The second takes those rows as its argument."
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c3",
      "label": "Lines through Central",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-lines-through-station",
      "out": "lines",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "station": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/central"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c4",
      "label": "Stations on those lines",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-stations-on-line",
      "out": "oneChange",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "value",
          "ref": "lines",
          "whenEmpty": "stop"
        }
      ],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md5",
      "source": "## The same chain, saved as a group\n\nA query group keeps the chain on the server, so an app or an agent runs it in one call."
    },
    {
      "kind": "group",
      "id": "c5",
      "label": "Stations one change away from Central",
      "group": "urn:sqlib:group:rail-one-change-away",
      "out": "group",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "station": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/central"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md6",
      "source": "## Rules\n\nThe Reachability rule set infers `:reaches` from the links between neighbouring stations. Its result is a graph."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ruleset",
      "id": "c6",
      "label": "Reachability",
      "ruleSet": "{{reachability}}",
      "out": "reach",
      "inputGraph": {
        "from": "dataGraph",
        "dataGraphId": "{{network}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md7",
      "source": "A property path gives the same stations without rules. The benchmark *Property path or rules* times the two."
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c7",
      "label": "Reachable from Central, by a property path",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-reachable-by-path",
      "out": "path",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "from": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/central"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    }
  ]
}
